==Finnish==

===Etymology===
Cognate to {{cog|krl|lokka}}. Compare Estonian {{m|et|lõugas||gull}}<ref>{{R:fi:SSA}}</ref>.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fi-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|okːi|lang=fi}}
* {{hyphenation|lok|ki|lang=fi}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# [[gull]], [[seagull]] {{gloss|any bird of the genus ''[[Larus]]'' within the family [[Laridae]]}}
# {{lb|fi|taxonomy}} [[gull]], [[seagull]] {{gloss|any bird of the family Laridae}}

====Usage notes====
In common usage the word '''''lokki''''' only refers to birds of genus ''Larus'', but in taxonomy the term covers whole of the family Laridae.

